comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-12T19:58:05.326Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check: pm-ed28wi (closed) introduced clone-local trust and fail-closed execution; pm-44iu and pm-mf5z (closed) enforce runnable linked tests; pm-zw9188 (closed) partitioned the linked-file staleness check by holder lifecycle, the closest shape. No open item owns settlement or accounting of the untrusted population; validate-warning ownership requires one."
